 ETW events that may be sent to Microsoft on a default installation of Windows.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eSee \u003ca href=\"/microsoft/winget-cli/blob/master/README.md#datatelemetry\"\u003edetails on telemetry\u003c/a\u003e, and our \u003ca href=\"/microsoft/winget-cli/blob/master/PRIVACY.md\"\u003eprimary privacy statement\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003edisable\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-disable\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: disable\" href=\"#disable\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"    \u0026quot;telemetry\u0026quot;: {\n        \u0026quot;disable\u0026quot;: true\n    },\"\u003e\u003cpre\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"pl-ent\"\u003e\"telemetry\"\u003c/span\u003e: {\n        \u003cspan class=\"pl-ent\"\u003e\"disable\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003etrue\u003c/span\u003e\n    },\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eIf set to true, the \u003ccode\u003etelemetry.disable\u003c/code\u003e setting 